      <profiles>
        <profile name="Calas Typhon" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xiv-3-calas-typhon-first-captain-profile-0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">9</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">2+/4+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      <profile id="r13-typhon-alchem" name="Alchem Flamer" hidden="false" typeId="prof-ranged" typeName="Ranged Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="ranged-range">Template</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="ranged-s">2</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="ranged-ap">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Type" typeId="ranged-type">Assault 1, Poisoned (3+)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xiv-3-calas-typhon-first-captain-source" hidden="true">
          <description>Calas Typhon | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 9 | 2+/4+
Force Organisation:
LATENT PSYKER Typhon is treated as a Psyker (Mastery Level 1\) solely for the purpose of using Aura of Pestilence and suffering Perils of the Warp. He knows no other psychic powers. Typhon takes the Psychic Test for Aura of Pestilence using Leadership 7 instead of the Leadership value shown in his profile. AURA OF PESTILENCE At the beginning of either player's Assault phase, Typhon may attempt to invoke Aura of Pestilence. If the Psychic Test is passed, every enemy model within 2" of Typhon suffers -1 Attack, to a minimum of 1, until the end of that Assault phase. If the Psychic Test is failed, every friendly model within 2" of Typhon instead suffers -1 Attack, to a minimum of 1, until the end of that Assault phase. Typhon may fight normally during an Assault phase in which Aura of Pestilence is used. COMMAND RETINUE Typhon may select either a Deathshroud Terminator Squad or Legion Terminator Command Squad as his retinue. The selected squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
• HQ
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Cataphractii Terminator Armour
• Manreaper
• Alchem Flamer
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Death Guard)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Latent Psyker
RESTRICTION
Calas Typhon may only be included in a Death Guard army of 1,500 points or more.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r11-dg-r41-unit-xiv-3-calas-typhon-first-captain-rule-0" name="Latent Psyker" hidden="false"><description>Typhon is treated as a Psyker (Mastery Level 1) solely for Aura of Pestilence and Perils of the Warp. He knows no other psychic powers and tests for Aura of Pestilence using Leadership 7.</description></rule><rule id="r11-dg-r41-unit-xiv-3-calas-typhon-first-captain-rule-1" name="Aura of Pestilence" hidden="false"><description>At the beginning of either player’s Assault phase Typhon may take a Psychic Test. If passed, enemy models within 2 inches suffer -1 Attack (minimum 1) until the end of the phase. If failed, friendly models within 2 inches suffer the penalty instead. Typhon fights normally.</description></rule><rule id="r13-dg-r41-unit-xiv-3-calas-typhon-first-captain-rule-0" name="Wargear" hidden="false"><description>Cataphractii Terminator Armour; Manreaper; Alchem Flamer.</description></rule><rule id="r13-dg-r41-unit-xiv-3-calas-typhon-first-captain-rule-1" name="Manreaper" hidden="false"><description>A Two-Handed Power Weapon. At the beginning of each Assault phase in which the bearer is engaged, roll a D3; the bearer gains that many additional Attacks until the end of the phase. If all attacks are directed against a single separately targetable enemy model, the bonus is only +1 Attack. No bonus Attack is gained for a second close-combat weapon.</description></rule><rule id="r13-dg-r41-unit-xiv-3-calas-typhon-first-captain-rule-2" name="Latent Psyker" hidden="false"><description>Typhon is treated as Psyker (Mastery Level 1) solely for Aura of Pestilence and Perils of the Warp. He knows no other psychic powers and tests for Aura using Leadership 7.</description></rule><rule id="r13-dg-r41-unit-xiv-3-calas-typhon-first-captain-rule-3" name="Aura of Pestilence" hidden="false"><description>At the beginning of either player’s Assault phase Typhon may take a Psychic Test. If passed, every enemy model within 2 inches suffers -1 Attack, minimum 1, until the end of the phase. If failed, every friendly model within 2 inches suffers the penalty instead. Typhon may fight normally.</description></rule></rules>
