      <profile id="r13-rask-phosphex" name="Phosphex Bomb" hidden="false" typeId="prof-ranged" typeName="Ranged Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Range" typeId="ranged-range">6"</characteristic><characteristic name="S" typeId="ranged-s">5</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="ranged-ap">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Type" typeId="ranged-type">Assault 1, Blast, One Use, Poisoned (3+), Lingering Death</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xiv-5-durak-rask-source" hidden="true">
          <description>Durak Rask | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 4 | 3 | 9 | 2+/5+
Force Organisation:
ART OF DESTRUCTION Durak Rask and any Death Guard Infantry unit he has joined have the Tank Hunters special rule. COMMAND RETINUE Durak Rask may select one Legion Command Squad as his retinue. The selected squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
• HQ
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Artificer Armour
• Refractor Field
• Thunder hammer
• Volkite Serpenta
• Nuncio Vox
• Phosphex Bomb
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Death Guard)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Art of Destruction
Allegiance:
• Traitor only
OPTIONS
• Durak Rask may take:
• Krak grenades ................................... +2 points
• Melta bombs .................................... +5 points</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r11-dg-r41-unit-xiv-5-durak-rask-rule-0" name="Art of Destruction" hidden="false"><description>Durak Rask and any Death Guard Infantry unit he has joined have Tank Hunters.

Tank Hunters: +1 to Armour Penetration rolls. Automatically passes Tank Shock Morale tests.</description></rule><rule id="r13-dg-r41-unit-xiv-5-durak-rask-rule-0" name="Wargear" hidden="false"><description>Artificer Armour; Refractor Field; Thunder hammer; Volkite Serpenta; Nuncio Vox; Phosphex Bomb; Frag grenades.</description></rule><rule id="r13-dg-r41-unit-xiv-5-durak-rask-rule-1" name="Art of Destruction" hidden="false"><description>Durak Rask and any Death Guard Infantry unit he has joined have the Tank Hunters special rule.

Tank Hunters: +1 to Armour Penetration rolls. Automatically passes Tank Shock Morale tests.</description></rule></rules>
