      </constraints>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Ignatius Grulgor" typeId="prof-model" typeName="Model" hidden="false" id="r41-unit-xiv-6-ignatius-grulgor-profile-0">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="WS" typeId="model-ws">6</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="BS" typeId="model-bs">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="S" typeId="model-s">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="model-t">4</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="model-w">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="I" typeId="model-i">5</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="A" typeId="model-a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Ld" typeId="model-ld">10</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="model-sv">3+/5+</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xiv-6-ignatius-grulgor-source" hidden="true">
          <description>Ignatius Grulgor | 6 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 3 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 3+/5+
Force Organisation:
THE EATER OF LIVES The first time Grulgor is reduced to 0 Wounds, do not immediately remove him as a casualty. Roll a D6. On a 1–4, remove Grulgor normally. On a 5+, Grulgor remains in play with 1 Wound remaining and gains the following special rules for the remainder of the battle: • Daemon • Fearless • Feel No Pain (5+) This rule may only be used once per battle. COMMAND RETINUE Grulgor may select one Legion Command Squad as his retinue. The selected squad does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot.
• HQ
Unit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Power Armour
• Refractor Field
• Power weapon
• Bolter
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Death Guard)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• The Eater of Lives
Allegiance:
• Traitor only
OPTIONS
• Grulgor may take:
• Krak grenades ................................... +2 points
• Melta bombs .................................... +5 points</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r11-dg-r41-unit-xiv-6-ignatius-grulgor-rule-0" name="The Eater of Lives" hidden="false"><description>The first time Grulgor is reduced to 0 Wounds, roll a D6 before removing him. On 1–4 remove him normally. On 5+ he remains with 1 Wound and gains Daemon, Fearless and Feel No Pain (5+) for the rest of the battle. This may only occur once.

Daemon: Model gains a 5+ Invulnerable Save and causes Fear.
Fearless: Automatically passes all Morale and Pinning tests. May not Take Cover! or choose to voluntarily fail a break test.</description></rule><rule id="r13-dg-r41-unit-xiv-6-ignatius-grulgor-rule-0" name="Wargear" hidden="false"><description>Power Armour; Refractor Field; Power weapon; Bolter; Bolt pistol; Frag grenades.</description></rule><rule id="r13-dg-r41-unit-xiv-6-ignatius-grulgor-rule-1" name="The Eater of Lives" hidden="false"><description>The first time Grulgor is reduced to 0 Wounds, roll a D6 before removing him. On 1–4 he is removed normally. On 5+, he remains with 1 Wound and gains Daemon, Fearless and Feel No Pain (5+) for the rest of the battle. This may only occur once per battle.

Daemon: Model gains a 5+ Invulnerable Save and causes Fear.
Fearless: Automatically passes all Morale and Pinning tests. May not Take Cover! or choose to voluntarily fail a break test.</description></rule></rules>
